  <steps>
    <step>Replace CreateRecordWizard's use of local NextStepsStep with WizardFollowOns FollowOnGrid + a FollowOnCardConfig[] declaring the current cards.</step>
    <step>Delete FollowOnSteps.tsx and the steps/ files that moved into WizardFollowOns; fix imports.</step>
    <step>Regression: exercise CreateEventWizard + CreateProjectWizard (which wrap CreateRecordWizard) — Next Steps cards + follow-on creation unchanged.</step>
    <step>Build + tests.</step>
  </steps>

  <tools>Read, Grep, Edit, Bash (grep for removed symbols), Skill(code-review)</tools>
